### LevelUp – W2 Inventaris I: OData-queries op de CatalogService
### Start eerst je server met: cds watch
### Klik in BAS/VS Code op "Send Request" boven elke query (extensie: REST Client)

@server = http://localhost:4004
@catalog = {{server}}/odata/v4/catalog

### 0. Wat biedt de service aan? (metadata)
GET {{catalog}}/$metadata

### 1. Alle games
GET {{catalog}}/Games

### 2. Enkel titel en prijs, duurste eerst
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title,price&$orderby=price desc

### 3. Alle RPG's onder 50 euro
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$filter=genre_code eq 'RPG' and price lt 50&$select=title,price

### 4. Hoeveel games zijn er voor PC?
GET {{catalog}}/Games/$count?$filter=platform_code eq 'PC'

### 5. Aantal games per platform
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$apply=groupby((platform_code),aggregate($count as aantal))

### 6. De 3 nieuwste releases
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title,releaseDate&$orderby=releaseDate desc&$top=3

### 7. Zoeken op titel
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$search=zelda&$select=title

### 8. Games met genre- en landnaam erbij ($expand)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title&$expand=genre($select=name),studioCountry($select=name)

### 9. Uitverkocht (voorraad 0)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$filter=stock eq 0&$select=title,stock

### Side quest: genres in het Nederlands
GET {{catalog}}/Genres?$select=code,name
Accept-Language: nl


### =====================================================================
### W3 · Inventaris II: relaties
### =====================================================================

@orders = {{server}}/odata/v4/orders
@lotte = c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### 10. Alle orders van Lotte, met items en gametitels, in één call
GET {{orders}}/Customers({{lotte}})?$select=firstName,lastName&$expand=orders($select=orderDate;$expand=items($select=quantity,unitPrice;$expand=game($select=title)))

### 11. Reviews van Elden Ring met de voornaam van de klant
GET {{catalog}}/Games(a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001)/reviews?$select=rating,comment&$expand=customer($select=firstName)

### 12. Games met hun tags (N:M)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title&$expand=tags($select=tag_code)

### 13. Omgekeerd: alle story-driven games (N:M, andere richting)
GET {{catalog}}/Tags('STORY')?$expand=games($expand=game($select=title))

### 14. Deep insert: één order met twee orderregels in één POST
# @name newOrder
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "items": [
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 39.99 }
  ]
}

### 15. Controle: het nieuwe order heeft 2 items
GET {{orders}}/Orders({{newOrder.response.body.ID}})?$expand=items

### 16. Order verwijderen: in W3 gingen de items mee (composition).
###     Vanaf W4 geweigerd (Deletable: false): een order annuleer je met cancel()
DELETE {{orders}}/Orders({{newOrder.response.body.ID}})

### 17. Controle: nog altijd 10 games
GET {{orders}}/Games/$count

### 18. Fout: order zonder klant wordt geweigerd (@mandatory)
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### Side quest: uitgever met al zijn games (bidirectioneel)
GET {{catalog}}/Publishers?$select=name&$expand=games($select=title)


### =====================================================================
### W4 · Spelregels: business logica
### =====================================================================

### 20. Fout: order zonder orderregels (400)
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "items": [] }

### 21. Fout: uitverkochte game (409) + aantal 0 (400) → twee fouten tegelijk
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "items": [
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004", "quantity": 1 },
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001", "quantity": 0 }
  ]
}

### 22. Geldige order: de server negeert onze prijs en ons totaal
# @name w4Order
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "totalAmount": 1,
  "items": [
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 0.01 },
    { "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 23. Voorraad van Halo Infinite is met 1 gedaald
GET {{orders}}/Games(a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007)?$select=title,stock

### 24. Bound action: order annuleren → status CANCELLED, voorraad terug
POST {{orders}}/Orders({{w4Order.response.body.ID}})/OrderService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 25. Nog eens annuleren → 409
POST {{orders}}/Orders({{w4Order.response.body.ID}})/OrderService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 26. Betaalde order annuleren → 409
POST {{orders}}/Orders(d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/OrderService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 27. Orders met hun status (code list)
GET {{orders}}/Orders?$select=orderDate,totalAmount&$expand=status($select=name,criticality)

### 28. Fout: review met rating 7 en te kort commentaar
POST {{catalog}}/Reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003", "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "rating": 7, "comment": "kort" }

### 29. Unbound function: top 3 games
GET {{catalog}}/topGames(limit=3)

### Side quest A: isNew (virtueel veld)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title,releaseDate,isNew&$orderby=releaseDate desc

### Side quest B: review door een klant die de game niet kocht → 403
POST {{catalog}}/Reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001", "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "rating": 4, "comment": "Heel mooie game echt" }

### Side quest C: open order betalen (en nog eens → 409)
POST {{orders}}/Orders(d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003)/OrderService.pay
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### W4 · gat gedicht: een orderregel toevoegen of wijzigen via de order omzeilt de validaties
###      → nu geweigerd (Insertable/Updatable: false op OrderItems, Updatable: false op Orders)
POST {{orders}}/Orders(d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003)/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "game_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004", "quantity": 999 }


### =====================================================================
### W5 · Beheerder Mode: AdminService met draft + Fiori Elements
### Apps: http://localhost:4004/admin-games/webapp/index.html
###       http://localhost:4004/leaderboard/webapp/index.html
### of via de "Fiori preview"-links op http://localhost:4004
### =====================================================================

@admin = {{server}}/odata/v4/admin

### 30. Lijst zoals de List Report ze opvraagt (enkel actieve records) + kleur voorraad
GET {{admin}}/Games?$select=title,stock,stockCriticality&$filter=IsActiveEntity eq true

### 31. Draft: nieuw concept aanmaken (nog niet zichtbaar in de catalogus)
# @name draft
POST {{admin}}/Games
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 32. Concept invullen
PATCH {{admin}}/Games(ID={{draft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hollow Knight: Silksong", "genre_code": "ACTION", "platform_code": "SWITCH", "price": 19.99, "currency_code": "EUR", "stock": 3 }

### 33. Concept activeren (= "Opslaan" in Fiori). Zonder titel → ASSERT_MANDATORY
POST {{admin}}/Games(ID={{draft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/AdminService.draftActivate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 34. Leaderboard (CDS-view): hoogste rating eerst
GET {{admin}}/GameLeaderboard?$orderby=avgRating desc,reviewCount desc
